WEBVTT

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.534
Direct hit.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:16.311
The target buoy is solid
monotanium ten meters thick,

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.977
shielded by a chromoelectric
force field.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:19.983
Impressive.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.417
L'm glad you agree.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:22.887
It's not wise
to travel this region

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.514
without adequate defenses.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.990
L've seen scuttled ships

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.152
with more firepower
than Voyager.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.684
L'm sure you have.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.128
Imagine what you'll

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:33.257
be capable of once
the isokinetic cannon

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.927
is integrated
into your defensive systems.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.995
One projectile
can penetrate the shields

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:41.506
of any heavily-armored vessel.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.999
Hostile species will
know to avoid Voyager

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:47.013
by reputation alone.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.911
You've made your point,
Mr. Kovin.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.143
L want the cannon.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:55.545
And l'm prepared to give you...

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:03.287
astrometric charts
spanning 12 sectors.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:06.264
You'll find them
unusually precise.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:10.133
Even the most sophisticated
charts become obsolete.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.469
One random anomaly and they're
no longer accurate.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:18.443
However, l could be persuaded
if you were to include

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.878
the mapping technology
that created them.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:21.881
Sorry.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.439
Our astrometric sensors

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:25.747
were designed specifically
for this ship.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.343
They'd be of no use to you.

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:29.514
What l can offer you

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:33.253
is a generous supply
of isolinear processing chips.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:35.659
We'll even show you
how to integrate them

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.993
into your existing
sensor technology.

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:40.555
How generous a supply?

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.897
100 chips.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:42.993
150.

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.003
115.

00:01:44.037 --> 00:01:45.004
125.

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:46.005
Done.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.563
Escort our guest to Engineering.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:51.566
You'll be supervising
the installation of the cannon?

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:54.580
Of course...
for a modest fee.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:57.412
Five additional chips.
No more.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.008
It's good to see
the art of negotiation

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:00.575
isn't lost on you, Captain.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.281
That guy is worse
than a Ferengi.

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:09.159
Assign Seven of Nine
to work on this.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.425
She's got a knack
for adapting alien technology.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.193
Should l give her
complete access

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.133
to the Engineering
control systems?

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:17.329
L'm ready to give her
some latitude.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.395
She's been
behaving herself lately.

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.672
What are you working on?

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:32.810
L'm trying to decode the message

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.752
Starfleet Command
sent us several weeks ago.

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.311
Any progress?

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:37.823
None.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:40.121
L'm working on a new
decryption algorithm.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.287
L'd like you to set
it aside for a while.

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:43.795
L have another assignment
for you.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.457
What is it?

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:46.988
The Captain wants you
to help Kovin

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:48.499
integrate the new weapon system.

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:49.502
L'd rather not.

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:50.764
L find him inefficient.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:51.792
Maybe so,

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:53.999
but you seem
to work well with him.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.770
You've been asking
for more responsibilities.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:58.003
L thought you'd be pleased.

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:59.908
The Captain gives me
greater liberty

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.641
only when she needs
my expertise.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:03.342
You violated her trust

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:06.477
and if you want it back,
you're going to have to earn it

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:08.487
one step at a time.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.962
L will report to Engineering.

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:24.765
You'll need to install
isolinear buffer circuits

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:27.136
here and here.

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:28.162
The main power relay

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.176
should be protected
by a containment field.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.075
Unnecessary.
All the buffer circuits

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:33.874
would have to fail
simultaneously

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:35.107
for there to be any danger.

00:03:35.148 --> 00:03:37.878
We prefer to play it safe.

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:40.784
L'll check the inventory logs
to see if we have

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.014
a field generator available.

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:55.296
What are you doing?

00:03:55.335 --> 00:03:57.963
L'm reconfiguring
the tactical control systems.

00:03:58.004 --> 00:03:59.972
The isokinetic
circuits requires

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:01.598
a specialized protocol.

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:02.801
Let me take care of it.

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:04.139
That won't be necessary.

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:09.906
No. No. The subroutines
need to be arranged

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:11.610
in cascading sequence.

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:12.913
Let me show you.

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:19.882
Seven, stop.

00:06:15.372 --> 00:06:18.432
There's a hairline fracture
of the premaxilla bone.

00:06:18.475 --> 00:06:21.569
Do you see this, Captain?
She shattered it.

00:06:21.612 --> 00:06:22.806
It's easily repaired.

00:06:22.846 --> 00:06:24.609
Do you have any idea
why Seven attacked you?

00:06:24.648 --> 00:06:25.615
Lt was unprovoked.

00:06:25.649 --> 00:06:28.675
She came at me like an animal.

00:06:28.719 --> 00:06:30.653
Well, l wouldn't put it
like that.

00:06:31.622 --> 00:06:34.250
L was at another console
about ten meters away.

00:06:34.291 --> 00:06:36.725
L heard Kovin raise his voice
and when l looked around

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:37.954
l saw that he was
holding her arm.

00:06:38.061 --> 00:06:40.086
L barely touched her!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.928
A gentle gesture
to move her out of my way,

00:06:42.966 --> 00:06:43.933
so l could get to the console.

00:06:43.967 --> 00:06:46.629
Then she turned on me,
attacked me.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.160
What did you say to her?

00:06:48.205 --> 00:06:49.331
L told her how to reconfigure

00:06:49.373 --> 00:06:51.967
the tactical control systems
properly.

00:06:52.042 --> 00:06:52.974
Is that all?

00:06:53.043 --> 00:06:54.408
That's all.

00:06:54.445 --> 00:06:56.777
And that's when she
knocked him down.

00:06:56.814 --> 00:06:59.339
Ashmore and l
had to hold her back.

00:06:59.383 --> 00:07:00.680
She would have killed me.

00:07:00.717 --> 00:07:01.911
That woman is dangerous.

00:07:02.019 --> 00:07:03.213
It's a miracle you survived.

00:07:03.253 --> 00:07:05.118
Now, hold still or this
won't heal properly.

00:07:06.156 --> 00:07:07.487
Why are you
questioning me on this?

00:07:07.524 --> 00:07:09.219
You should be disciplining
your crew member.

00:07:09.259 --> 00:07:11.022
Believe me, l'll deal with it.

00:07:11.061 --> 00:07:12.926
Please accept
my sincere apology.

00:07:12.963 --> 00:07:14.021
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:07:16.934 --> 00:07:18.162
Good as new.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:24.832
Come in.

00:07:33.951 --> 00:07:36.886
Here we are again.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.411
Oh, l'm tired of having
this conversation.

00:07:39.456 --> 00:07:40.684
You know what l'm going to say.

00:07:40.724 --> 00:07:42.089
L know how you're
going to respond,

00:07:42.125 --> 00:07:44.150
so it seems pointless
to say anything.

00:07:44.194 --> 00:07:46.526
Shall l consider
my privileges restricted

00:07:46.563 --> 00:07:48.588
and confine myself
to the cargo bay?

00:07:48.632 --> 00:07:49.963
L think we've established

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.968
that traditional
disciplinary actions

00:07:52.002 --> 00:07:53.936
don't work with you.

00:07:53.971 --> 00:07:57.498
The question is:
What will?

00:07:57.541 --> 00:07:59.941
Are you asking for my opinion?

00:07:59.977 --> 00:08:01.410
L suppose l am...

00:08:01.445 --> 00:08:04.608
because frankly,
l'm running out of options.

00:08:04.648 --> 00:08:06.741
Throwing you in the brig
isn't going to solve anything.

00:08:06.783 --> 00:08:08.375
Neither is slapping you
on the wrist.

00:08:08.418 --> 00:08:10.443
And it's not as though
l don't understand

00:08:10.487 --> 00:08:11.818
your feelings about Kovin.

00:08:11.855 --> 00:08:14.085
There have been a few times
when l'd have liked

00:08:14.124 --> 00:08:15.250
to pop him in the nose myself,

00:08:15.292 --> 00:08:16.884
but you have to start
learning the difference

00:08:16.927 --> 00:08:20.624
between having an impulse
and acting on it.

00:08:20.664 --> 00:08:23.394
Does that make any sense to you?

00:08:24.668 --> 00:08:26.192
L believe so.

00:08:26.236 --> 00:08:28.033
L will give it more thought.

00:08:29.039 --> 00:08:31.405
Well, that's a start.

00:08:33.777 --> 00:08:36.610
L hear there was some excitement
this morning.

00:08:36.647 --> 00:08:39.946
When l started helping you
improve your social skills,

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:43.178
l'm fairly certain l didn't
include a boxing lesson.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.188
You weren't hurt, were you?

00:08:45.222 --> 00:08:46.587
No.

00:08:47.991 --> 00:08:49.652
Still a bit tense?

00:08:50.861 --> 00:08:52.692
Perhaps.

00:08:52.729 --> 00:08:55.163
L understand
the burden you carry...

00:08:55.198 --> 00:08:57.325
constantly being obligated
to deal with those

00:08:57.367 --> 00:08:59.198
who fall short of excellence.

00:08:59.236 --> 00:09:01.636
L often find my own patience

00:09:01.672 --> 00:09:04.505
being tested by someone
like Mr. Kovin.

00:09:04.541 --> 00:09:06.839
Of course, l generally respond
with a devastating quip

00:09:06.877 --> 00:09:08.276
rather than a left hook.

00:09:11.181 --> 00:09:12.910
We must both accept
the fact that very few

00:09:13.016 --> 00:09:16.179
life-forms will ever meet
our high standards.

00:09:16.219 --> 00:09:19.586
So, when you get irritated
just try to be tolerant,

00:09:19.623 --> 00:09:22.854
and remember... they can't
help being what they are.

00:09:22.893 --> 00:09:26.693
Hmm... l'm reading some
increased engramatic activity

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:29.631
and your adrenaline levels
are slightly elevated.

00:09:29.666 --> 00:09:31.133
What does that indicate?

00:09:31.168 --> 00:09:34.103
Lt's consistent with a state
of heightened tension.

00:09:34.137 --> 00:09:35.502
Lie down
and l'll run some scans.

00:09:37.207 --> 00:09:41.075
In a typical human, l would
consider this a mood swing,

00:09:41.111 --> 00:09:43.579
but with your unique physiology,
l'd like to rule out

00:09:43.614 --> 00:09:45.639
the possibility
of a chemical imbalance.

00:09:52.289 --> 00:09:53.950
Have you been experiencing

00:09:54.024 --> 00:09:56.515
any other symptoms...
headaches, disorientation?

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.391
No.

00:10:03.266 --> 00:10:06.360
Physiological scans seem normal.

00:10:06.403 --> 00:10:08.837
L'm going to check
your Borg implants now.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.535
Seven... what's wrong?

00:10:12.576 --> 00:10:14.476
Let me out.

00:10:14.511 --> 00:10:16.103
L will. Stay calm.

00:10:22.185 --> 00:10:23.812
No more procedures.

00:10:23.854 --> 00:10:25.412
- All right.
- Stay away!

00:10:25.455 --> 00:10:27.355
You mustn't do this.

00:10:27.391 --> 00:10:28.551
Do what?

00:10:28.592 --> 00:10:30.560
Seven, what are you
so afraid of?

00:10:32.696 --> 00:10:33.924
L don't know.

00:10:40.704 --> 00:10:42.865
She experienced an episode
of acute anxiety

00:10:42.906 --> 00:10:45.306
with all the trimmings...
intense apprehension,

00:10:45.342 --> 00:10:47.139
shortness of breath, dizziness.

00:10:47.177 --> 00:10:49.008
L finally managed to sedate her.

00:10:49.046 --> 00:10:52.015
Could this have been caused
by her cortical implants?

00:10:52.049 --> 00:10:53.175
L don't think so.

00:10:53.216 --> 00:10:55.684
L think the problem has to
do with memory suppression.

00:10:55.719 --> 00:10:58.153
L've detected
a high concentration

00:10:58.188 --> 00:11:00.850
of biogenic amines
in Seven's hippocampus...

00:11:00.891 --> 00:11:02.688
a substance l haven't
noticed before.

00:11:02.726 --> 00:11:04.921
It's blocking several portions
of her memory center.

00:11:04.961 --> 00:11:06.087
Do you know where it came from?

00:11:06.129 --> 00:11:08.825
No, but it seems
to be dissipating.

00:11:08.865 --> 00:11:11.766
Seven's unusual behavior
may be the result

00:11:11.802 --> 00:11:13.895
of the blocked memories
beginning to surface...

00:11:13.937 --> 00:11:16.201
memories which she can't
identify yet.

00:11:16.239 --> 00:11:17.331
Can you treat her?

00:11:17.374 --> 00:11:18.341
Treatment would involve

00:11:18.375 --> 00:11:19.637
integrating
the repressed memories

00:11:19.676 --> 00:11:21.166
into Seven's consciousness.

00:11:21.211 --> 00:11:23.805
L may be able to use
a standard therapeutic

00:11:23.847 --> 00:11:25.280
regression technique.

00:11:25.315 --> 00:11:27.112
L wasn't aware
that you were programmed

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:28.811
with psychotherapeutic
capabilities.

00:11:28.852 --> 00:11:31.548
L wasn't, but in the absence
of a Ship's Counselor,

00:11:31.588 --> 00:11:33.988
l've been developing
a psychiatric subroutine

00:11:34.024 --> 00:11:34.991
to add to my program.

00:11:35.092 --> 00:11:38.619
L'll be even more valuable
to you than l am now.

00:11:38.662 --> 00:11:40.061
Keep me informed, Doctor.

00:11:43.066 --> 00:11:44.931
Hmm.

00:11:45.068 --> 00:11:46.262
A Jungian therapist

00:11:46.303 --> 00:11:48.669
would attempt to retrieve
unconscious memories

00:11:48.705 --> 00:11:52.300
by exploring synchronicities
in recent events.

00:11:52.342 --> 00:11:54.401
On the other hand,
Amanin of Betazed

00:11:54.444 --> 00:11:58.005
would argue that a combination
of sensory isolation

00:11:58.048 --> 00:12:01.313
and focused breathing techniques
would be more effective.

00:12:01.351 --> 00:12:03.945
L've integrated
the finer points of both

00:12:04.054 --> 00:12:07.182
to create my own approach
to memory reconstruction.

00:12:07.224 --> 00:12:09.658
What does this approach involve?

00:12:09.693 --> 00:12:10.887
First, putting you at ease

00:12:10.927 --> 00:12:13.919
by performing the treatment
here in your own environment.

00:12:13.964 --> 00:12:15.090
Once the cortical probes

00:12:15.132 --> 00:12:17.123
have reinforced
the neural pathways,

00:12:17.167 --> 00:12:19.465
l'll use a directed
imagery technique

00:12:19.503 --> 00:12:21.266
to guide you
through the regression.

00:12:23.206 --> 00:12:24.696
You may proceed.

00:12:26.877 --> 00:12:28.970
Please close your eyes.

00:12:29.012 --> 00:12:31.173
Clear your mind.

00:12:31.214 --> 00:12:33.876
Try not to think or to analyze.

00:12:35.118 --> 00:12:36.949
My mind is now clear.

00:12:36.987 --> 00:12:40.980
Seven, this isn't
an exercise in efficiency.

00:12:41.057 --> 00:12:42.649
Close your eyes.

00:12:43.693 --> 00:12:46.184
Breathe deeply.

00:12:46.229 --> 00:12:49.198
Now concentrate
on the sound of my voice.

00:12:49.232 --> 00:12:51.097
Let go of the present.

00:12:51.134 --> 00:12:54.365
Leave the cargo bay behind.

00:12:54.404 --> 00:12:58.204
Allow yourself...
to drift.

00:13:01.778 --> 00:13:05.077
Describe the first image
that enters your mind.

00:13:07.884 --> 00:13:09.875
A medical tricorder.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:12.684
Duratanium casing.

00:13:12.722 --> 00:13:15.191
7.6 centimeters
by 9.8 centimeters

00:13:15.324 --> 00:13:17.918
by 3.2 centimeters.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:19.621
Alpha-numeric display...

00:13:19.662 --> 00:13:21.527
That's enough.

00:13:21.564 --> 00:13:22.690
So...

00:13:24.934 --> 00:13:26.799
you're in Sick Bay.

00:13:26.835 --> 00:13:30.771
How does the tricorder
make you feel?

00:13:32.808 --> 00:13:34.469
Lt disturbs me.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:35.875
Why does it disturb you?

00:13:35.911 --> 00:13:37.936
L'm afraid it will hurt me.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:39.379
Is there anything else there

00:13:39.415 --> 00:13:41.906
that causes you
to anticipate pain?

00:13:43.619 --> 00:13:45.211
The diagnostic bed.

00:13:45.254 --> 00:13:47.245
It's closing around me.

00:13:47.289 --> 00:13:49.814
You feel restrained, confined.

00:13:49.858 --> 00:13:51.382
Yes. L am uneasy.

00:13:51.427 --> 00:13:52.416
About what?

00:13:56.765 --> 00:13:57.754
Lt's Kovin.

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:59.563
What is he doing?

00:13:59.602 --> 00:14:02.571
He's restraining me.

00:14:02.605 --> 00:14:05.574
L want to get away from him,
but l can't.

00:14:11.013 --> 00:14:13.504
Kovin's using some kind
of instrument on me.

00:14:18.621 --> 00:14:19.781
Seven?

00:14:20.823 --> 00:14:23.587
L didn't recall this before.

00:14:23.626 --> 00:14:25.253
Recall what?

00:14:25.294 --> 00:14:27.660
Kovin. He...

00:14:29.031 --> 00:14:31.693
he performed
a surgical procedure on me.

00:14:31.734 --> 00:14:34.726
He... extracted Borg technology

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.067
from my body.

00:14:38.107 --> 00:14:40.439
He violated me.

00:14:45.547 --> 00:14:46.639
We're making progress.

00:14:46.682 --> 00:14:47.774
Now, tell me.

00:14:47.816 --> 00:14:49.841
This surgical procedure...

00:14:49.885 --> 00:14:51.910
when did it happen?

00:14:51.954 --> 00:14:52.921
L don't know.

00:14:52.955 --> 00:14:54.582
The details are vague.

00:14:54.623 --> 00:14:55.988
There are only images.

00:14:56.091 --> 00:14:57.786
And you're sure it was Kovin?

00:14:58.894 --> 00:15:00.589
Did you see Kovin?

00:15:00.629 --> 00:15:02.392
Yes.

00:15:02.431 --> 00:15:04.422
You said
he was restraining you,

00:15:04.466 --> 00:15:05.728
using an instrument

00:15:05.768 --> 00:15:07.565
- of some sort.
- He was.

00:15:07.603 --> 00:15:09.400
Were you on Voyager
when this happened?

00:15:11.073 --> 00:15:12.938
No.

00:15:12.975 --> 00:15:14.442
It must have been when we were

00:15:14.476 --> 00:15:16.273
testing the weapons
on the surface.

00:15:16.312 --> 00:15:18.644
Then concentrate
on that away mission.

00:15:18.681 --> 00:15:22.139
Focus on the first image
that enters your mind.

00:15:26.288 --> 00:15:28.085
Describe it for me.

00:15:28.123 --> 00:15:29.818
A large granitic stone...

00:15:29.858 --> 00:15:32.554
approximately
one-half meter high.

00:15:32.594 --> 00:15:36.758
Now, allow that memory
to develop beyond the image.

00:15:36.799 --> 00:15:38.858
Integrate it
into your consciousness.

00:15:38.901 --> 00:15:41.096
Let the memory take shape.

00:15:46.275 --> 00:15:48.368
L'm at the weapons range.

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:49.843
Kovin had taken us there

00:15:49.878 --> 00:15:52.244
to evaluate various
handheld firearms

00:15:52.281 --> 00:15:54.078
he wished to offer in trade.

00:16:00.155 --> 00:16:03.283
He attempted to impress us
with a demonstration

00:16:03.325 --> 00:16:05.793
of the weapons'
destructive capabilities.

00:16:05.828 --> 00:16:09.093
My role was to provide
a more objective analysis.

00:16:09.131 --> 00:16:10.928
Terawatt powered
particle beam rifle.

00:16:11.033 --> 00:16:13.627
Four microsecond recharge cycle.

00:16:13.669 --> 00:16:15.500
Ten kilometer range.

00:16:15.537 --> 00:16:18.563
Definitely
not standard Starfleet issue.

00:16:18.607 --> 00:16:20.165
What do you think?

00:16:20.209 --> 00:16:23.940
72 percent fragmentation,
28 percent vaporization.

00:16:23.979 --> 00:16:26.709
Crude but efficient.

00:16:26.749 --> 00:16:29.479
It's not as accurate
as our compression rifles,

00:16:29.518 --> 00:16:31.543
but it's a lot easier to handle.

00:16:31.587 --> 00:16:33.179
L wouldn't mind
carrying one of these

00:16:33.222 --> 00:16:35.156
the next time we run
into the Hirogen.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:37.784
The targeting mechanism
could be augmented

00:16:37.826 --> 00:16:40.420
with a thermal guidance sensor.

00:16:40.462 --> 00:16:42.896
That would increase
accuracy by 24 percent.

00:16:42.931 --> 00:16:44.558
L can do that now.

00:16:46.502 --> 00:16:48.094
Care to join me?

00:16:48.137 --> 00:16:49.399
You can make sure
that the adjustments

00:16:49.438 --> 00:16:51.099
are performed
to your specifications.

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:52.869
If you don't mind,

00:16:52.908 --> 00:16:54.671
l'd like to test
some of the other firearms.

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:55.677
Go right ahead.

00:16:57.379 --> 00:16:58.937
This way.

00:17:02.484 --> 00:17:04.850
Kovin took me
to a small laboratory.

00:17:04.887 --> 00:17:06.616
Describe it.

00:17:06.655 --> 00:17:08.646
It was poorly illuminated.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:12.182
L saw various instruments...
technology unfamiliar to me.

00:17:12.227 --> 00:17:15.492
L assumed this was where he
developed new weapon designs.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.330
This weapon is thoron-based.

00:17:20.369 --> 00:17:22.200
Most of these handheld
disruptors are.

00:17:22.237 --> 00:17:25.035
Thoron can be unstable
in weapons.

00:17:25.073 --> 00:17:27.166
Not if you polarize
the emitter matrix.

00:17:27.209 --> 00:17:29.734
That compensates
for any instabilities.

00:17:29.778 --> 00:17:32.042
Watch.

00:17:37.886 --> 00:17:39.911
What are you doing?

00:17:39.955 --> 00:17:41.923
He turned the weapon on me.

00:17:41.957 --> 00:17:43.686
He fired?

00:17:43.725 --> 00:17:45.590
Yes, l remember it now.

00:17:45.627 --> 00:17:47.185
What happened next?

00:17:49.231 --> 00:17:50.926
L'm not sure.

00:17:50.966 --> 00:17:52.490
Concentrate.

00:17:52.534 --> 00:17:55.059
See the laboratory in your mind.

00:17:56.205 --> 00:17:58.196
There was a light in my eyes.

00:18:02.211 --> 00:18:04.702
Was Kovin still
in the room with you?

00:18:04.746 --> 00:18:05.906
Yes.

00:18:05.981 --> 00:18:07.710
Restrain her. Quickly.

00:18:07.749 --> 00:18:10.343
And another Entharan
was assisting him.

00:18:11.854 --> 00:18:13.116
This is Borg technology.

00:18:13.155 --> 00:18:16.249
That's what l've been
telling you.

00:18:16.291 --> 00:18:18.054
Let me go.

00:18:18.093 --> 00:18:20.391
They bound me
to an examination table.

00:18:20.429 --> 00:18:21.828
What did they do to you?

00:18:21.864 --> 00:18:23.297
Did they scan you?

00:18:26.335 --> 00:18:29.827
The bio-ablation pump
is engaged and pressurized.

00:18:43.252 --> 00:18:45.686
The growth medium
is activating the implants.

00:18:45.721 --> 00:18:47.712
The nanoprobes are multiplying.

00:18:52.427 --> 00:18:54.418
They put a device near my head.

00:18:54.463 --> 00:18:57.227
They removed my ocular implant.

00:18:59.368 --> 00:19:01.199
And...

00:19:01.236 --> 00:19:04.137
some of the implants in my arm
were activated.

00:19:04.172 --> 00:19:06.106
Which ones?

00:19:06.141 --> 00:19:07.665
Can you be more specific?

00:19:07.709 --> 00:19:11.770
Use the maximum setting
of the metagenic pulse

00:19:11.813 --> 00:19:13.508
to stimulate the implants.

00:19:14.616 --> 00:19:17.551
The assimilation
tubules are ready.

00:19:17.586 --> 00:19:20.578
Prepare to harvest
the nanoprobes.

00:19:24.826 --> 00:19:26.919
They extracted nanoprobes

00:19:27.029 --> 00:19:29.054
through
my assimilation tubules.

00:19:29.097 --> 00:19:33.329
L was powerless...
unable to stop them.

00:19:33.368 --> 00:19:35.233
You couldn't be expected to.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:39.297
You were restrained.
Then what happened?

00:19:39.341 --> 00:19:41.775
They took the nanoprobes
to another subject...

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:45.075
also restrained... and they...

00:19:45.113 --> 00:19:46.546
they assimilated him.

00:19:52.554 --> 00:19:53.885
Well done.

00:19:58.894 --> 00:20:02.295
The next thing l remember,
l was back in Kovin's lab.

00:20:02.331 --> 00:20:04.595
He claimed the particle beam
rifle overloaded...

00:20:04.633 --> 00:20:07.659
that it burned my hand...
but it was a lie.

00:20:07.703 --> 00:20:09.398
They had attacked me.

00:20:09.438 --> 00:20:12.896
L'm sorry.
L should have been more careful.

00:20:14.509 --> 00:20:15.976
Do you have
a dermal regenerator?

00:20:16.044 --> 00:20:17.033
Of course.

00:20:27.889 --> 00:20:29.720
L'll inform the Captain.

00:20:38.166 --> 00:20:39.360
There's no doubt

00:20:39.401 --> 00:20:41.995
that Seven was the victim
of a brutal assault.

00:20:42.104 --> 00:20:43.002
How is she?

00:20:43.105 --> 00:20:44.970
As well as can be expected.

00:20:45.007 --> 00:20:46.907
She's regenerating
in her alcove.

00:20:46.942 --> 00:20:50.309
L predict her emotional recovery
will take some time.

00:20:50.345 --> 00:20:53.405
L certainly hope you intend
to hold Kovin responsible

00:20:53.448 --> 00:20:54.745
for what he's done.

00:20:54.783 --> 00:20:57.013
First, l want to know how much
of her story we can corroborate.

00:20:57.052 --> 00:20:58.451
Tom, you were with her
on the planet.

00:20:58.487 --> 00:21:00.580
How long was she alone
with Kovin?

00:21:00.622 --> 00:21:02.317
At least two hours.

00:21:02.357 --> 00:21:03.324
And when she came back,

00:21:03.358 --> 00:21:04.950
did she say anything
about what happened?

00:21:04.993 --> 00:21:07.257
Only that they'd finished
their work on the rifle.

00:21:07.295 --> 00:21:08.496
She seemed fine.

00:21:08.629 --> 00:21:10.358
Clearly, Mr. Kovin used
some artificial means

00:21:10.397 --> 00:21:12.422
to suppress her memory
of the event.

00:21:12.466 --> 00:21:14.764
That would explain
the unusual engramatic activity

00:21:14.802 --> 00:21:16.963
l found
in her neurological scans.

00:21:17.004 --> 00:21:18.471
Did you find
any other physical evidence

00:21:18.506 --> 00:21:20.838
of the medical procedures
she described?

00:21:20.875 --> 00:21:22.672
No.

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:26.339
L suspect Mr. Kovin
used Seven's own nanoprobes

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.439
to repair any cellular damage.

00:21:28.482 --> 00:21:31.679
She distinctly remembers
Kovin extracting them.

00:21:31.719 --> 00:21:35.314
You seen to be accepting Seven's
recovered memories as fact.

00:21:35.356 --> 00:21:36.789
Are you suggesting otherwise?

00:21:36.824 --> 00:21:38.792
Historically,
recovered memories

00:21:38.826 --> 00:21:40.123
have often proven unreliable.

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:42.685
Yes, in cases where
a traumatic experience

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:44.561
has been repressed for years.

00:21:44.598 --> 00:21:46.998
But we're dealing with
a very recent memory here

00:21:47.034 --> 00:21:49.332
that was blocked
by artificial means.

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:50.735
When l removed that mechanism,

00:21:50.771 --> 00:21:52.762
Seven remembered everything
that happened.

00:21:52.806 --> 00:21:55.104
Human memory is rarely perfect.

00:21:55.142 --> 00:21:56.734
What are you saying, Tuvok?

00:21:56.777 --> 00:21:58.711
That Seven is making this up?

00:21:58.746 --> 00:22:01.044
No, but we must remember

00:22:01.081 --> 00:22:03.845
that she's experienced
hallucinatory images before.

00:22:03.884 --> 00:22:05.442
That was in direct response

00:22:05.486 --> 00:22:07.954
to a signal from the ship
where she was assimilated.

00:22:08.022 --> 00:22:10.081
She's not having
hallucinations now.

00:22:10.124 --> 00:22:11.751
She's remembering
what happened to her.

00:22:11.792 --> 00:22:12.952
L've confirmed this

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:14.960
by analyzing the specific
engramatic activity

00:22:14.995 --> 00:22:15.962
in her hippocampus.

00:22:16.063 --> 00:22:17.963
We're not talking
about conjecture.

00:22:18.065 --> 00:22:19.157
We're talking about science.

00:22:19.199 --> 00:22:20.723
Let's not get bogged down.

00:22:22.736 --> 00:22:24.670
Seven has made
serious accusations

00:22:24.705 --> 00:22:26.195
and l won't dismiss them.

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:28.606
If Kovin assaulted her

00:22:28.642 --> 00:22:31.372
and took a sample
of her Borg technology,

00:22:31.412 --> 00:22:32.970
we can't stand by
and do nothing.

00:22:33.047 --> 00:22:35.208
In the wrong hands,
a single nanoprobe

00:22:35.249 --> 00:22:36.841
could lead to disaster.

00:22:36.884 --> 00:22:38.977
Doctor, l want you
to keep searching

00:22:39.053 --> 00:22:42.181
for any physical evidence
to back up Seven's claim.

00:22:42.222 --> 00:22:43.883
L will talk to Kovin.

00:22:43.924 --> 00:22:45.516
Dismissed.

00:22:50.598 --> 00:22:52.793
This is offensive and absurd!

00:22:52.833 --> 00:22:54.323
She's obviously lying.

00:22:54.368 --> 00:22:56.495
Why would she do that?

00:22:56.537 --> 00:22:58.266
Maybe you can answer that.

00:22:58.305 --> 00:22:59.704
She's your crew member.

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:00.832
First, she attacks me,

00:23:00.874 --> 00:23:03.035
then, she invents
these ridiculous stories

00:23:03.077 --> 00:23:04.840
and you try
to place the blame on me.

00:23:04.878 --> 00:23:07.244
Is this some kind
of negotiating tactic?

00:23:07.281 --> 00:23:08.441
L have no hidden agenda.

00:23:08.482 --> 00:23:10.575
L'm simply trying
to clarify what happened.

00:23:10.618 --> 00:23:11.607
L told you already.

00:23:11.652 --> 00:23:12.880
We went to my laboratory

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:15.718
to adjust the guidance system
on the particle beam rifle.

00:23:15.756 --> 00:23:17.724
And that took two hours?

00:23:17.758 --> 00:23:20.454
She insisted
on absolute precision.

00:23:21.495 --> 00:23:23.656
We've confirmed
that Seven was exposed

00:23:23.697 --> 00:23:25.528
to an intense thoron discharge.

00:23:25.566 --> 00:23:28.592
She was... after the rifle's
power cell overloaded.

00:23:28.636 --> 00:23:30.900
We reported the accident
immediately.

00:23:30.938 --> 00:23:34.305
She now remembers that you fired
the weapon at her deliberately.

00:23:34.341 --> 00:23:35.638
That's preposterous.

00:23:35.676 --> 00:23:36.904
The Doctor tells me

00:23:36.944 --> 00:23:39.606
the blast could have been enough
to render her unconscious.

00:23:39.647 --> 00:23:40.978
But it didn't.

00:23:41.048 --> 00:23:43.414
We were both startled
for a moment

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:45.213
and after l apologized
for the accident,

00:23:45.252 --> 00:23:47.277
she asked if l had
a dermal regenerator,

00:23:47.321 --> 00:23:49.687
which l did,
and l used it on her arm...

00:23:49.723 --> 00:23:51.782
the one
with the mechanical implants.

00:23:51.825 --> 00:23:53.725
Which you recognized as Borg.

00:23:53.761 --> 00:23:55.592
L was aware she'd been a Borg.

00:23:55.629 --> 00:23:56.755
She told me herself.

00:23:56.797 --> 00:24:00.426
Did you ever express curiosity
in that technology

00:24:00.467 --> 00:24:01.934
or try to examine it

00:24:02.002 --> 00:24:03.264
more closely?

00:24:03.303 --> 00:24:04.395
No.

00:24:04.438 --> 00:24:07.066
You never considered
the potential value

00:24:07.107 --> 00:24:08.768
it might have as a weapon?

00:24:10.277 --> 00:24:12.472
Ls that
what you think l've done?

00:24:12.513 --> 00:24:13.946
You may not realize

00:24:14.048 --> 00:24:16.676
how dangerous
Borg technology can be.

00:24:16.717 --> 00:24:18.514
If you've taken
even a single nanoprobe,

00:24:18.552 --> 00:24:20.520
l need to know about it
right now.

00:24:20.554 --> 00:24:22.181
L haven't taken anything.

00:24:24.324 --> 00:24:26.485
L'd like to examine
your laboratory

00:24:26.527 --> 00:24:27.960
to be absolutely sure.

00:24:27.995 --> 00:24:29.326
No.

00:24:29.363 --> 00:24:31.456
This has already gone too far.

00:24:32.866 --> 00:24:35.096
Then l'll have to contact
the authorities.

00:24:35.135 --> 00:24:37.296
Maybe they'll be more helpful.

00:24:37.337 --> 00:24:39.430
Are you willing to risk
our trade agreement

00:24:39.473 --> 00:24:43.136
all on the basis
of one crew member's delusions?

00:24:43.177 --> 00:24:44.508
Yes.

00:24:44.545 --> 00:24:46.069
Now...

00:24:46.113 --> 00:24:49.105
are you going to cooperate
with our investigation?

00:24:50.951 --> 00:24:53.181
L don't seem
to have much choice.

00:25:02.029 --> 00:25:05.590
You stated that the rifle's
power cell overloaded

00:25:05.632 --> 00:25:07.623
as a result of a faulty
oscillator adjustment.

00:25:07.667 --> 00:25:09.828
That's right.

00:25:11.705 --> 00:25:15.835
Can you describe in more detail
how that occurred?

00:25:16.943 --> 00:25:19.912
L was showing her how to
polarize the emitter matrix.

00:25:19.946 --> 00:25:22.881
L must have tuned the induction
frequency too high.

00:25:22.916 --> 00:25:25.180
Were you unfamiliar
with that procedure?

00:25:25.218 --> 00:25:26.276
No.

00:25:26.319 --> 00:25:27.650
L have done it 100 times.

00:25:27.687 --> 00:25:29.086
It was a careless mistake.

00:25:29.122 --> 00:25:31.113
How many times do l need
to apologize?

00:25:31.158 --> 00:25:33.490
L am not seeking
a statement of remorse.

00:25:33.527 --> 00:25:34.892
Then what do you want?

00:25:34.928 --> 00:25:36.862
Are you trying to catch me
in a lie?

00:25:36.897 --> 00:25:38.831
Trick me into confessing?

00:25:38.865 --> 00:25:41.698
You can't, because there's
nothing for me to confess!

00:25:41.735 --> 00:25:43.862
L haven't done anything wrong!

00:25:45.105 --> 00:25:47.630
One of our crew members
claims that you have.

00:25:50.610 --> 00:25:52.976
Your crew member,
Seven of Nine...

00:25:53.046 --> 00:25:55.344
she's very fortunate.

00:25:55.382 --> 00:25:56.974
How so?

00:25:57.084 --> 00:26:00.679
She has an entire crew
leaping to her defense.

00:26:00.720 --> 00:26:02.051
L have no one.

00:26:02.089 --> 00:26:05.490
The Entharan representative
will be here shortly.

00:26:05.525 --> 00:26:06.924
You mean the magistrate?

00:26:06.960 --> 00:26:09.258
He won't help me.

00:26:09.296 --> 00:26:12.231
He's more interested in
protecting diplomatic relations

00:26:12.265 --> 00:26:13.823
with people like you.

00:26:13.867 --> 00:26:16.734
Surely, he'll want to know
the truth.

00:26:16.770 --> 00:26:19.534
That's all we're seeking.

00:26:19.573 --> 00:26:20.699
You don't understand.

00:26:20.740 --> 00:26:24.039
On my world, we depend on trade
with alien species.

00:26:24.077 --> 00:26:27.911
There are strict protocols
about those relationships.

00:26:27.948 --> 00:26:31.884
Even being accused of violating
them is a serious offense.

00:26:31.918 --> 00:26:35.410
You will have the opportunity
to refute any charges.

00:26:35.455 --> 00:26:36.683
It won't matter.

00:26:36.723 --> 00:26:39.214
Once they're made,
the damage is done.

00:26:39.259 --> 00:26:41.523
L won't be trusted any longer.

00:26:41.561 --> 00:26:43.051
L'll be ruined.

00:26:43.096 --> 00:26:45.530
Please...

00:26:45.565 --> 00:26:48.728
l never hurt your crew member.

00:26:50.370 --> 00:26:52.702
Don't do this.

00:26:52.739 --> 00:26:54.969
L'm afraid l have no choice.

00:26:55.075 --> 00:26:57.305
But l assure you

00:26:57.344 --> 00:26:59.073
our investigation
will be conducted

00:26:59.112 --> 00:27:01.410
in a fair and impartial manner.

00:27:01.448 --> 00:27:04.474
You strike me as a man
of your word.

00:27:06.686 --> 00:27:09.655
If you tell me
l won't be prejudged,

00:27:09.689 --> 00:27:12.385
then l believe you.

00:27:19.966 --> 00:27:21.593
How are you feeling?

00:27:21.635 --> 00:27:23.296
L am undamaged.

00:27:23.336 --> 00:27:25.133
But how do you feel?

00:27:25.172 --> 00:27:29.700
Seven, your physical scars
have healed,

00:27:29.743 --> 00:27:32.439
but the psychological effects
are still there.

00:27:32.479 --> 00:27:34.106
You'll have to deal with them.

00:27:34.147 --> 00:27:35.614
For what purpose?

00:27:35.649 --> 00:27:37.241
In order to heal.

00:27:37.284 --> 00:27:39.775
Kovin attacked you...

00:27:39.819 --> 00:27:42.310
violated your rights
as an individual.

00:27:42.355 --> 00:27:44.346
It's important
that you recognize that

00:27:44.391 --> 00:27:46.951
so you can understand
any hostility or resentment

00:27:47.027 --> 00:27:48.392
you might be feeling.

00:27:48.428 --> 00:27:50.487
Resentment is a human trait.

00:27:50.530 --> 00:27:52.794
It has no structure,
no function.

00:27:52.832 --> 00:27:54.424
L want no part of it.

00:27:54.467 --> 00:27:55.832
You're going to have
to begin accepting

00:27:55.869 --> 00:27:57.962
the fact that your
human feelings exist

00:27:58.004 --> 00:28:00.302
and that suppressing them
can damage you.

00:28:01.575 --> 00:28:04.203
If l am not aware
of these feelings,

00:28:04.244 --> 00:28:05.802
how can l express them?

00:28:05.845 --> 00:28:07.369
Let me ask you this.

00:28:09.416 --> 00:28:11.247
What would have happened

00:28:11.284 --> 00:28:14.378
if Kovin had tried
to take Borg technology

00:28:14.421 --> 00:28:16.321
directly from the collective?

00:28:16.356 --> 00:28:17.914
He would have been assimilated.

00:28:18.024 --> 00:28:20.219
Precisely.
Which is why he chose you.

00:28:20.260 --> 00:28:23.161
He could get what he wanted
without running any risks.

00:28:25.465 --> 00:28:28.366
It was my individuality
which made me vulnerable.

00:28:28.401 --> 00:28:29.561
Exactly.

00:28:31.304 --> 00:28:33.101
He violated that individuality.

00:28:33.139 --> 00:28:35.767
What he did is an affront
to everything you are...

00:28:35.809 --> 00:28:36.935
Borg and human.

00:28:37.043 --> 00:28:39.307
It was the act of a coward.

00:28:39.346 --> 00:28:40.677
Yes!

00:28:40.714 --> 00:28:42.944
Someone who was
willing to use you

00:28:43.016 --> 00:28:44.142
in the cruelest way

00:28:44.184 --> 00:28:46.675
so that he could
create new weapons

00:28:46.720 --> 00:28:48.210
and sell them.

00:28:48.255 --> 00:28:52.885
L believe l am beginning
to experience anger.

00:28:52.926 --> 00:28:54.484
Anger toward Kovin.

00:28:54.527 --> 00:28:58.725
Good. That's a perfectly
healthy, normal response.

00:28:58.765 --> 00:29:00.528
And when Kovin
gets what he deserves,

00:29:00.567 --> 00:29:03.035
you're going to feel
much better.

00:29:06.206 --> 00:29:08.037
Right this way, Magistrate.

00:29:08.074 --> 00:29:09.666
My laboratory.

00:29:15.482 --> 00:29:17.712
There are no examination tables.

00:29:17.751 --> 00:29:19.446
L told you.
Just workbenches.

00:29:19.486 --> 00:29:21.283
Is this the entire facility?

00:29:21.321 --> 00:29:22.811
Yes.

00:29:22.856 --> 00:29:24.084
We should scan for signs

00:29:24.124 --> 00:29:26.490
that the room
may have been altered recently.

00:29:31.164 --> 00:29:32.825
During her regression,

00:29:32.866 --> 00:29:35.300
Seven described instruments
similar to these.

00:29:35.335 --> 00:29:36.461
Of course she did.

00:29:36.503 --> 00:29:37.561
She was here.

00:29:37.604 --> 00:29:39.196
She said a device

00:29:39.239 --> 00:29:42.697
like this was used
to remove her optic implant.

00:29:42.742 --> 00:29:44.232
That's a micro-caliper.

00:29:44.277 --> 00:29:46.472
L used it to remove the casings

00:29:46.513 --> 00:29:49.209
over the guidance system
on the particle beam rifle.

00:29:52.819 --> 00:29:55.379
And isn't this
an electrodynamic probe?

00:29:55.422 --> 00:29:57.049
Yes.

00:29:57.090 --> 00:29:59.558
Hmm.

00:29:59.592 --> 00:30:02.117
It's equipped
with a monofilament stimulator.

00:30:02.162 --> 00:30:04.460
Could it be used to manipulate
the neurotransmitter levels

00:30:04.497 --> 00:30:05.589
in a human brain?

00:30:05.632 --> 00:30:06.929
Not as it is.

00:30:06.966 --> 00:30:08.627
But with the proper
modifications?

00:30:08.668 --> 00:30:09.692
With the proper modifications,

00:30:09.736 --> 00:30:11.294
l could reconfigure
your combadge

00:30:11.338 --> 00:30:12.965
to manipulate neurotransmitters.

00:30:13.073 --> 00:30:14.062
What's your point?

00:30:14.107 --> 00:30:15.574
L believe you've just made it.

00:30:21.981 --> 00:30:24.882
There's cellular residue
on many of these instruments.

00:30:24.918 --> 00:30:27.853
It matches Seven's genome.

00:30:30.390 --> 00:30:31.721
With your permission, sir,

00:30:31.758 --> 00:30:33.692
l'd like to take these tools
back to Voyager

00:30:33.727 --> 00:30:35.820
where l can run
more conclusive scans.

00:30:35.862 --> 00:30:37.853
Take whatever you need.

00:30:37.897 --> 00:30:39.660
Doctor, there are a number

00:30:39.699 --> 00:30:42.395
of Borg nanoprobes
on the surface of this table.

00:30:42.435 --> 00:30:44.926
L'll just collect a sample.

00:30:52.145 --> 00:30:53.772
Hmm...

00:30:53.813 --> 00:30:57.010
That's where her arm was hit
when the rifle overloaded.

00:30:57.117 --> 00:30:58.675
The dispersal pattern
is consistent

00:30:58.718 --> 00:31:00.185
with a dermal rupture.

00:31:00.220 --> 00:31:02.814
These nanoprobes were
recently regenerated.

00:31:02.856 --> 00:31:05.347
If this were nothing more
than cellular residue

00:31:05.392 --> 00:31:08.725
from Seven's injury,
the nanoprobes would be dormant.

00:31:08.762 --> 00:31:12.027
But these have been activated
in a very specific pattern.

00:31:13.066 --> 00:31:14.124
L have seen enough.

00:31:14.167 --> 00:31:17.568
Kovin, there is
sufficient evidence here

00:31:17.604 --> 00:31:20.664
to detain you pending
official proceedings.

00:31:20.707 --> 00:31:22.299
No.

00:31:22.342 --> 00:31:25.038
Please... no.

00:31:27.347 --> 00:31:28.314
Stay where you are.

00:31:28.348 --> 00:31:29.906
Kovin, don't...

00:31:29.949 --> 00:31:31.382
l trusted you.

00:31:31.418 --> 00:31:33.818
You said it would be
an impartial investigation,

00:31:33.853 --> 00:31:37.254
but you're all determined
to find what you want to find.

00:31:37.290 --> 00:31:39.224
Well, l'm not going
to let this happen.

00:31:44.831 --> 00:31:46.093
Tuvok to Voyager.

00:31:46.132 --> 00:31:47.156
Janeway here.

00:31:47.200 --> 00:31:49.600
Mr. Kovin has transported
out of the laboratory.

00:31:49.636 --> 00:31:51.263
Can you track
his present position?

00:31:51.304 --> 00:31:52.635
Stand by.

00:31:52.672 --> 00:31:55.436
L'm picking up
a transporter signature

00:31:55.475 --> 00:31:57.375
300 kilometers
above the surface.

00:31:57.410 --> 00:31:58.638
Captain, there's

00:31:58.678 --> 00:32:00.942
a ship powering its engines
at those coordinates.

00:32:00.980 --> 00:32:02.948
Magistrate, do you want us
to follow him?

00:32:02.982 --> 00:32:05.280
Yes... but l'd like
to join you.

00:32:05.318 --> 00:32:06.285
Very well.

00:32:06.319 --> 00:32:08.685
We'll beam you to Voyager.
Stand by.

00:32:13.259 --> 00:32:17.127
Kovin's ship is on a heading
of 18 mark 25.

00:32:17.163 --> 00:32:18.755
Set an intercept course.

00:32:18.798 --> 00:32:20.561
Get ready to lock on
a tractor beam.

00:32:20.600 --> 00:32:22.591
He's only at half impulse.

00:32:22.635 --> 00:32:24.364
His ship may not have
warp engines.

00:32:24.404 --> 00:32:27.237
We're at 9,000 kilometers
and closing.

00:32:27.273 --> 00:32:29.036
L'm engaging the tractor beam.

00:32:34.981 --> 00:32:36.039
L can't find him.

00:32:37.083 --> 00:32:39.711
All of my sensor readings
have disappeared.

00:32:39.752 --> 00:32:40.912
He generated a photonic pulse.

00:32:40.954 --> 00:32:41.943
It took them off-line.

00:32:41.988 --> 00:32:44.479
We'll have to reinitialize
the entire sensor array.

00:32:44.524 --> 00:32:45.513
Do it.

00:32:48.795 --> 00:32:52.565
Our investigation has suddenly
turned into a manhunt.

00:32:52.698 --> 00:32:53.562
The fact that he's running

00:32:53.599 --> 00:32:54.998
shows that he's got
something to hide.

00:32:55.100 --> 00:32:58.160
Until we find out what that is,
we can't risk letting him go.

00:33:05.444 --> 00:33:08.709
Captain's Log, Stardate 51679.4.

00:33:08.747 --> 00:33:10.806
We've detected the warp
signature from Kovin's ship

00:33:10.849 --> 00:33:11.873
and we're now in pursuit.

00:33:11.917 --> 00:33:13.544
In the meantime,

00:33:13.586 --> 00:33:16.885
Tuvok and l have been examining
the tools from Kovin's lab.

00:33:16.922 --> 00:33:18.947
This isn't getting us anywhere.

00:33:19.058 --> 00:33:22.391
Seven's cellular residue
is on every one of these,

00:33:22.428 --> 00:33:24.828
but that would be true
if she simply handled them.

00:33:24.863 --> 00:33:27.889
My examination of the rifle
is equally inconclusive.

00:33:27.933 --> 00:33:30.458
It may have overloaded
accidentally...

00:33:30.502 --> 00:33:31.628
or not.

00:33:32.738 --> 00:33:35.536
L'm getting a bad feeling
about this, Tuvok.

00:33:35.574 --> 00:33:39.203
We aren't finding anything
that implicates Kovin.

00:33:39.244 --> 00:33:43.203
L told him our investigation
would be impartial.

00:33:43.248 --> 00:33:44.374
L believe it has been.

00:33:44.416 --> 00:33:45.713
It has...

00:33:45.751 --> 00:33:48.549
but l'll admit l had some
preconceptions about him.

00:33:48.587 --> 00:33:52.114
They may have influenced
my judgment.

00:33:52.157 --> 00:33:54.148
The strongest evidence so far

00:33:54.193 --> 00:33:56.423
is the nanoprobes
the Doctor found.

00:33:56.462 --> 00:33:57.986
The fact that they
were regenerated

00:33:58.063 --> 00:34:00.588
suggests that Kovin was
experimenting with them.

00:34:00.633 --> 00:34:03.625
We don't know a great deal
about the interaction

00:34:03.669 --> 00:34:06.069
between nanoprobes
and Borg physiology.

00:34:06.105 --> 00:34:07.333
It might be worthwhile

00:34:07.373 --> 00:34:09.864
to simulate the effect
of the rifle blast

00:34:09.908 --> 00:34:10.932
on Seven's arm

00:34:10.976 --> 00:34:12.910
and see what happens
to the nanoprobes.

00:34:12.945 --> 00:34:16.073
Good. Maybe that'll
give us some answers.

00:34:18.984 --> 00:34:21.077
Is this really necessary,
Captain?

00:34:21.120 --> 00:34:22.951
She's suffered
enough trauma already.

00:34:23.055 --> 00:34:24.647
We don't want
to make accusations

00:34:24.690 --> 00:34:25.884
against an innocent man.

00:34:25.924 --> 00:34:29.951
We have to do everything we can
to find some concrete evidence.

00:34:29.995 --> 00:34:31.724
He is not an innocent man.

00:34:31.764 --> 00:34:33.425
L know what he did to me.

00:34:33.465 --> 00:34:35.092
But we must have proof.

00:34:35.134 --> 00:34:37.796
And this experiment
may provide us with it.

00:34:37.836 --> 00:34:39.599
We've configured this hypospray

00:34:39.638 --> 00:34:41.833
to simulate the energy
of a thoron blast.

00:34:41.874 --> 00:34:44.240
We'll collect thin layers
of your skin tissue

00:34:44.276 --> 00:34:45.573
and examine the effects.

00:34:45.611 --> 00:34:46.805
It won't be painful.

00:34:46.845 --> 00:34:49.211
L am not afraid.
L am angry.

00:34:49.248 --> 00:34:50.772
L know.
Try to be patient.

00:34:50.816 --> 00:34:53.307
We may have some answers soon.

00:34:56.155 --> 00:34:57.747
All right, let's see
what we've got.

00:35:18.911 --> 00:35:20.640
L think you better take a look.

00:35:31.056 --> 00:35:32.250
What do you see?

00:35:35.594 --> 00:35:39.223
The nanoprobes...
are regenerating

00:35:39.264 --> 00:35:40.492
in exactly the same pattern

00:35:40.532 --> 00:35:42.159
we saw
in Kovin's laboratory.

00:35:42.201 --> 00:35:44.669
It appears to be
a spontaneous response

00:35:44.703 --> 00:35:45.795
which could have been caused

00:35:45.838 --> 00:35:47.635
by the energy released
from the thoron weapon.

00:35:47.673 --> 00:35:50.301
It doesn't matter.
Kovin is guilty.

00:35:50.342 --> 00:35:51.900
Seven...

00:35:51.944 --> 00:35:53.468
there's no doubt in my mind

00:35:53.512 --> 00:35:54.774
that you believe
what you're saying,

00:35:54.813 --> 00:35:56.974
but is it possible...
just possible...

00:35:57.082 --> 00:35:59.243
that the memories you
and the Doctor recovered

00:35:59.284 --> 00:36:01.377
aren't accurate?

00:36:02.421 --> 00:36:03.786
How could that be?

00:36:03.822 --> 00:36:08.521
During your time with the Borg,
you were subjected to invasive

00:36:08.560 --> 00:36:10.084
medical procedures.

00:36:10.129 --> 00:36:11.926
You undoubtedly witnessed
other victims

00:36:11.997 --> 00:36:13.589
being assimilated.

00:36:13.632 --> 00:36:15.793
Could that be
what you're remembering?

00:36:17.569 --> 00:36:18.831
You know that's not right.

00:36:18.871 --> 00:36:19.929
Tell them.

00:36:20.038 --> 00:36:22.734
Everything led me to believe
that you were a victim.

00:36:22.775 --> 00:36:25.744
Your extreme response
to Kovin in Engineering,

00:36:25.778 --> 00:36:28.144
your irrational fear
when l was examining you...

00:36:28.180 --> 00:36:30.614
something prompted that
behavior, and l believed

00:36:30.649 --> 00:36:33.049
it was a repressed memory
of your ordeal

00:36:33.085 --> 00:36:34.211
with Kovin.

00:36:34.253 --> 00:36:35.584
That is what it was.

00:36:35.621 --> 00:36:39.455
But if l'm to be impartial,
l have to acknowledge

00:36:39.491 --> 00:36:42.585
that your neurology is still
something of a mystery to me.

00:36:42.628 --> 00:36:46.223
L can't be certain
what triggered those memories.

00:36:46.265 --> 00:36:48.733
And we can't ignore the fact

00:36:48.767 --> 00:36:51.497
that this evidence
supports Kovin's story...

00:36:51.537 --> 00:36:52.868
and not yours.

00:36:54.273 --> 00:36:57.071
You were the one who helped me
to understand what happened

00:36:57.109 --> 00:36:58.371
and now you're denying it.

00:36:58.410 --> 00:37:01.379
Seven, no one's abandoning you,
but we have to do what's right.

00:37:01.413 --> 00:37:03.938
We have to find Kovin
and tell him what we learned.

00:37:06.518 --> 00:37:08.179
The Doctor told me
l would feel better

00:37:08.220 --> 00:37:10.279
when Kovin gets
what he deserves.

00:37:11.356 --> 00:37:13.847
L want him to be punished.

00:37:13.892 --> 00:37:16.417
L won't settle
for anything less.

00:37:31.276 --> 00:37:32.368
Mr. Paris.

00:37:32.411 --> 00:37:33.935
He's in range.

00:37:34.046 --> 00:37:35.604
Visual.

00:37:35.647 --> 00:37:36.978
Hail him.

00:37:38.150 --> 00:37:39.811
No response.

00:37:39.852 --> 00:37:41.717
He's charging weapons.

00:37:41.753 --> 00:37:43.516
Open a channel...
all frequencies.

00:37:43.555 --> 00:37:45.750
Mr. Kovin,
this is Captain Janeway.

00:37:45.791 --> 00:37:49.090
We believe we've made a mistake
in accusing you.

00:37:49.127 --> 00:37:51.493
We only want to correct
the situation.

00:37:51.530 --> 00:37:53.555
Stand down your weapons.

00:37:55.334 --> 00:37:56.801
He's responding.

00:37:57.603 --> 00:37:58.865
Stop your pursuit.

00:37:58.904 --> 00:38:00.565
L can damage your ship.

00:38:00.606 --> 00:38:02.471
We're not here
to take you by force.

00:38:02.507 --> 00:38:04.338
Then let me go.

00:38:04.376 --> 00:38:05.343
Kovin, listen to me.

00:38:05.377 --> 00:38:07.675
The proceedings
must be resolved.

00:38:07.713 --> 00:38:09.237
This is a trap.

00:38:09.281 --> 00:38:10.680
No.

00:38:10.716 --> 00:38:13.184
We've discovered information
that supports your story.

00:38:13.218 --> 00:38:15.186
L don't believe you.

00:38:15.220 --> 00:38:17.211
We've reexamined the evidence.

00:38:17.256 --> 00:38:20.487
Finding the nanoprobes led us
to the wrong conclusion.

00:38:20.525 --> 00:38:23.460
We know now that your thoron
rifle did overload.

00:38:23.495 --> 00:38:24.689
Please...

00:38:28.700 --> 00:38:30.759
He's firing a spread
of photon pulses.

00:38:32.838 --> 00:38:34.328
Shields down to 82 percent.

00:38:35.307 --> 00:38:36.501
Back off.

00:38:36.541 --> 00:38:37.940
Give him some breathing room.

00:38:38.043 --> 00:38:40.273
He's coming about,
heading right for us.

00:38:45.017 --> 00:38:47.144
Direct hit to the power grid.

00:38:47.185 --> 00:38:49.153
Innocent or not, he's going
to destroy your vessel.

00:38:49.187 --> 00:38:50.848
Captain?

00:38:50.889 --> 00:38:53.153
He's come under enough fire
from us already.

00:38:53.191 --> 00:38:54.886
Harry, try to beam him
off his ship.

00:38:54.927 --> 00:38:56.554
He's thrown up
a scattering field.

00:38:56.595 --> 00:38:57.789
L can't get a lock.

00:38:57.829 --> 00:38:59.296
Keep trying.

00:39:01.233 --> 00:39:02.666
Shields are down.

00:39:02.701 --> 00:39:05.499
He's shunting all power
to his photonic emitters.

00:39:05.537 --> 00:39:08.199
We must protect ourselves.
Disable his ship.

00:39:08.240 --> 00:39:10.868
No. Evasive maneuvers...
hard to port, full thrusters.

00:39:10.909 --> 00:39:12.103
Aye.

00:39:13.178 --> 00:39:16.341
L've almost got a lock on him...
a few more seconds.

00:39:16.381 --> 00:39:17.746
He's charging weapons again.

00:39:17.783 --> 00:39:19.910
Captain,
his emitters are overloading.

00:39:20.018 --> 00:39:21.918
All his systems
are destabilizing.

00:39:22.020 --> 00:39:22.918
Open a channel.

00:39:23.021 --> 00:39:25.251
Kovin, shut down
your scattering field.

00:39:25.290 --> 00:39:26.484
Let us beam you aboard.

00:39:27.893 --> 00:39:28.825
Kovin!

00:39:28.860 --> 00:39:29.827
He's firing.

00:39:37.369 --> 00:39:38.495
Harry?!

00:39:40.205 --> 00:39:42.901
L can't find anything
to lock on to, Captain.

00:39:51.083 --> 00:39:53.608
There's nothing more
we could have done.

00:39:57.756 --> 00:39:59.280
Stand down Red Alert.

00:40:03.762 --> 00:40:07.391
Mr. Paris, set a course
back to the Entharan colony.

00:40:28.553 --> 00:40:33.650
Chief Medical Officer's Log,
Stardate 51658.2.

00:40:33.691 --> 00:40:36.558
L've spent the past three days
being cross-examined

00:40:36.594 --> 00:40:38.585
by the Entharan authorities,

00:40:38.630 --> 00:40:41.656
but the matter
is finally resolved.

00:40:48.373 --> 00:40:49.670
Doctor.

00:40:49.707 --> 00:40:51.334
Yes.

00:40:51.376 --> 00:40:53.537
L'm here
for my weekly maintenance.

00:40:53.578 --> 00:40:55.102
Oh, of course.

00:40:55.146 --> 00:40:56.408
This way, please.

00:41:02.754 --> 00:41:03.948
Metabolic rate is stable.

00:41:04.022 --> 00:41:08.220
Electro-optic implant
is aligned.

00:41:09.561 --> 00:41:12.928
Your blood pressure
is... slightly off

00:41:12.964 --> 00:41:14.795
but within tolerance.

00:41:14.833 --> 00:41:15.959
You're in perfect health.

00:41:16.067 --> 00:41:16.965
See you next week.

00:41:17.068 --> 00:41:19.502
L do not feel perfect.

00:41:19.537 --> 00:41:21.698
What do you mean?

00:41:21.739 --> 00:41:25.266
L am preoccupied
by Kovin's death.

00:41:29.414 --> 00:41:31.348
Join the club.

00:41:31.382 --> 00:41:33.646
It's all l can think about.

00:41:33.685 --> 00:41:36.085
As a Borg, l was responsible

00:41:36.120 --> 00:41:38.486
for the destruction
of countless millions

00:41:38.523 --> 00:41:39.649
and l felt nothing,

00:41:39.691 --> 00:41:41.386
but now...

00:41:41.426 --> 00:41:44.554
l regret the destruction
of this single being.

00:41:44.596 --> 00:41:46.723
It's called remorse, Seven.

00:41:46.764 --> 00:41:50.632
It comes into play
when you make a mistake...

00:41:50.668 --> 00:41:53.967
and you feel guilt
about what you've done.

00:41:54.005 --> 00:41:58.408
Another new emotion
for you to experience.

00:41:58.443 --> 00:42:02.209
L do not enjoy this remorse
any more than l enjoyed anger.

00:42:02.247 --> 00:42:04.078
Will the feeling subside?

00:42:04.115 --> 00:42:08.074
Yes... but not quickly.

00:42:08.119 --> 00:42:10.553
L would rather not have to wait.

00:42:10.588 --> 00:42:12.920
L'm afraid you don't
have much choice.

00:42:22.133 --> 00:42:23.998
But maybe l do.

00:42:25.570 --> 00:42:28.539
L've isolated the algorithms
responsible for my desire

00:42:28.573 --> 00:42:31.201
to expand beyond
my original programming.

00:42:32.911 --> 00:42:34.674
L want to delete them.

00:42:35.780 --> 00:42:37.111
Why?

00:42:37.148 --> 00:42:40.743
Lt was my... urge to experiment,

00:42:40.785 --> 00:42:42.753
my infatuation
with improving myself

00:42:42.787 --> 00:42:44.254
that led to this tragedy.

00:42:45.957 --> 00:42:49.688
L fancied myself a psychologist,
a Ship's Counselor,

00:42:49.727 --> 00:42:52.560
but l wasn't prepared
for the complexities that come

00:42:52.597 --> 00:42:54.360
with such a responsibility.

00:42:54.399 --> 00:42:56.458
In my enthusiasm
to help Seven of Nine,

00:42:56.501 --> 00:42:58.435
l lost my medical objectivity.

00:42:58.469 --> 00:43:01.029
L became
a self-righteous advocate.

00:43:01.072 --> 00:43:03.836
L didn't stop to think
for one second

00:43:03.875 --> 00:43:06.207
that l might be wrong.

00:43:08.546 --> 00:43:10.707
That mustn't happen again.

00:43:10.748 --> 00:43:12.943
You want to go back
to the state you were in

00:43:12.984 --> 00:43:15.077
when we first activated you?

00:43:15.119 --> 00:43:16.211
L'll still be capable

00:43:16.254 --> 00:43:18.654
of treating
any and all medical conditions,

00:43:18.690 --> 00:43:21.989
but without the risk
of overstepping my bounds.

00:43:23.194 --> 00:43:25.059
It's for the best, Captain.

00:43:25.096 --> 00:43:27.155
Oh, l'm not so sure.

00:43:27.198 --> 00:43:29.962
This crew has benefited greatly

00:43:30.034 --> 00:43:32.628
from your improvements
over the years.

00:43:32.670 --> 00:43:34.604
Request denied.

00:43:34.639 --> 00:43:36.129
- Captain...
- I won't turn back

00:43:36.174 --> 00:43:38.335
the clock
because of one mistake...

00:43:38.376 --> 00:43:39.900
no matter how serious...

00:43:41.279 --> 00:43:43.907
and no matter
how you might feel.

00:43:52.624 --> 00:43:55.092
L'm a physician.

00:43:55.126 --> 00:43:58.186
L'm supposed to preserve life,
not destroy it.

00:44:00.064 --> 00:44:04.865
L can't live with the thought
that... l might do it again.

00:44:06.337 --> 00:44:07.804
With any luck...

00:44:09.107 --> 00:44:12.338
that knowledge will prevent it
from happening again.

00:44:12.377 --> 00:44:15.642
We all rallied around Seven,
Doctor, myself included.

00:44:18.316 --> 00:44:21.217
L wanted her to know that she
was part of this family,

00:44:21.252 --> 00:44:24.187
that we would support her,
fight for her no matter what.

00:44:24.222 --> 00:44:27.282
We let our good intentions
blind us.

00:44:28.660 --> 00:44:31.595
We all bear responsibility
for Kovin's death...

00:44:33.531 --> 00:44:35.590
and we all have to live with it.

00:44:37.769 --> 00:44:39.430
But to delete that burden

00:44:39.470 --> 00:44:42.530
would be the last thing
any of us should do.
